{
    "title": "MedStar eVisit \u2013 Telehealth",
    "description": "Need medical care? MedStar eVisit - Telehealth makes it easy to get the urgent care you need anywhere, anytime. No need to drive to the doctor or sit in waiting rooms. Our medical team is available 24 hours a day, seven days a week by secure video on your mobile device or computer. It takes only a minute to sign up and no appointments are needed.\r\n\r\nYour provider will consult with you and diagnose, send a prescription if needed, or help you with a referral as appropriate. Your virtual care is only a click away and costs $79 if you choose self-pay. Many insurance plans are accepted.\r\n\r\nOur experienced providers can provide the care you need, quickly. Common conditions treated include: \r\n\r\n            \u00b7 Rash or hives\r\n\r\n            \u00b7 Headaches or migraines\r\n\r\n            \u00b7 Sinus infection\r\n\r\n            \u00b7 Urinary tract infections in females\r\n\r\n            \u00b7 Tick-borne illness (Lyme)\r\n\r\n            \u00b7 Seasonal allergies\r\n\r\n            \u00b7 Pink eye\r\n\r\n            \u00b7 Nausea, vomiting, or diarrhea\r\n\r\n            \u00b7 Joint or back pain\r\n\r\n            \u00b7 Minor cuts or burns\r\n\r\n            \u00b7 Insect or minor animal or human bites\r\n\r\n            \u00b7 Minor falls without head injury\r\n\r\n            \u00b7  Minor motor vehicle accidents without bone tenderness or pain\r\n \r\nConvenient, affordable care is at your fingertips with three easy steps:\r\n\r\n            Download the app\r\n\r\n            Sign up\r\n\r\n            Choose your provider\r\n\r\nBe ahead of the game\u2014download the app and sign up now, so when you need it, virtual care from MedStar Health is only a click away.\r\n\r\nMedStar eVisit - Telehealth takes your privacy seriously. Your visit with the provider is secure and HIPAA compliant.\r\n\r\nMedStar Health\u2019s physicians, nurses, researchers, and support staff are all focused on one thing\u2014caring for you and your family. Our 30,000 associates and 6,000 affiliated physicians support MedStar Health\u2019s patient-first philosophy of care, compassion, clinical excellence, and customer service. We proudly care for more than half a million patients each year across Maryland and the Washington, D.C., region in our hospitals, urgent care centers, ambulatory centers, and physician offices. Our extensive network of providers enables us to offer the highest quality, most advanced care\u2014close to where our patients live and work. And, because we are committed to our not-for-profit mission, we remain dedicated to reinvesting in the health and wellness of all the communities we serve.\r\n\r\nMedStarHealth.org\r\n\r\nPatient Testimonials\r\n\r\n\u201cIt was fast, easy, and the visit was from the comfort of my own home. It doesn\u2019t get any better!\"\r\nMedStar eVisit User\r\n\r\n\u201cThe doctor I saw took her time to understand my condition and provided a thoughtful diagnosis. The care I received was equally as good as any care at an in-person visit. I will definitely use MedStar eVisit again, and I will recommend it to my friends and family.\"\r\nMedStar eVisit User\r\n\r\n\u201cThis service saved me so much time...I was able to get my daughter's health concerns addressed without having to leave the house or mess up nap time!\u201d \r\nMedStar eVisit User\r\n\r\nConnect with Us\r\n\r\nTo learn more or get your questions answered, please reach out to us!\r\n\r\nWeb: https://www.medstarhealth.org/services/medstar-evisit-telehealth\r\n\r\nEmail: medstar-evisit@medstar.net",
    "descriptionHTML": "Need medical care? MedStar eVisit - Telehealth makes it easy to get the urgent care you need anywhere, anytime. No need to drive to the doctor or sit in waiting rooms. Our medical team is available 24 hours a day, seven days a week by secure video on your mobile device or computer. It takes only a minute to sign up and no appointments are needed.<br><br>Your provider will consult with you and diagnose, send a prescription if needed, or help you with a referral as appropriate. Your virtual care is only a click away and costs $79 if you choose self-pay. Many insurance plans are accepted.<br><br>Our experienced providers can provide the care you need, quickly. Common conditions treated include: <br><br>            \u00b7 Rash or hives<br><br>            \u00b7 Headaches or migraines<br><br>            \u00b7 Sinus infection<br><br>            \u00b7 Urinary tract infections in females<br><br>            \u00b7 Tick-borne illness (Lyme)<br><br>            \u00b7 Seasonal allergies<br><br>            \u00b7 Pink eye<br><br>            \u00b7 Nausea, vomiting, or diarrhea<br><br>            \u00b7 Joint or back pain<br><br>            \u00b7 Minor cuts or burns<br><br>            \u00b7 Insect or minor animal or human bites<br><br>            \u00b7 Minor falls without head injury<br><br>            \u00b7  Minor motor vehicle accidents without bone tenderness or pain<br> <br>Convenient, affordable care is at your fingertips with three easy steps:<br><br>            Download the app<br><br>            Sign up<br><br>            Choose your provider<br><br>Be ahead of the game\u2014download the app and sign up now, so when you need it, virtual care from MedStar Health is only a click away.<br><br>MedStar eVisit - Telehealth takes your privacy seriously. Your visit with the provider is secure and HIPAA compliant.<br><br>MedStar Health\u2019s physicians, nurses, researchers, and support staff are all focused on one thing\u2014caring for you and your family. Our 30,000 associates and 6,000 affiliated physicians support MedStar Health\u2019s patient-first philosophy of care, compassion, clinical excellence, and customer service. We proudly care for more than half a million patients each year across Maryland and the Washington, D.C., region in our hospitals, urgent care centers, ambulatory centers, and physician offices. Our extensive network of providers enables us to offer the highest quality, most advanced care\u2014close to where our patients live and work. And, because we are committed to our not-for-profit mission, we remain dedicated to reinvesting in the health and wellness of all the communities we serve.<br><br>MedStarHealth.org<br><br>Patient Testimonials<br><br>\u201cIt was fast, easy, and the visit was from the comfort of my own home. It doesn\u2019t get any better!&quot;<br>MedStar eVisit User<br><br>\u201cThe doctor I saw took her time to understand my condition and provided a thoughtful diagnosis. The care I received was equally as good as any care at an in-person visit. I will definitely use MedStar eVisit again, and I will recommend it to my friends and family.&quot;<br>MedStar eVisit User<br><br>\u201cThis service saved me so much time...I was able to get my daughter&#39;s health concerns addressed without having to leave the house or mess up nap time!\u201d <br>MedStar eVisit User<br><br>Connect with Us<br><br>To learn more or get your questions answered, please reach out to us!<br><br>Web: https://www.medstarhealth.org/services/medstar-evisit-telehealth<br><br>Email: medstar-evisit@medstar.net",
